Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pivot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to wait\Nuntil I get the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to wait\Nuntil I get the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt and I were having a disagreement when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suddenly an entity began\Nto speak through Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.94,0:01:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It showed us images of the past when we\Nfirst saw the Digimon four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we saw past images of Piedmon\Nattempting to steal the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-eggs of what were to\Neventually become our Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A young Gennai rescued the eggs and\Ntook them to the safety of Vile Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where we first found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:02:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After our history lesson, Kari returned\Nto normal, but Matt still wanted to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi and Joe also\Nseparated from the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, there won't be\Nanyone left to save either world!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}MetalEtemon's Counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal-Etenmon-no-gyakushu!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.37,0:02:32.33,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Woodmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.37,0:02:32.33,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.37,0:02:32.33,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.37,0:02:32.33,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Plant Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.37,0:02:32.33,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.37,0:02:32.33,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Branch Drain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.40,0:02:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you pile of Woodmon!\NI know your tricks. You pretend to be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trees and then absorb the energy from\Nunsuspecting digimon as they pass by
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is your last warning all\Nright you ask for it how many
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,woodmon can an ogremon chuck if\Nan ogremon could chuck woodmon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should run fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, can I tell you something? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I wasn't too selfish for\Nsaying I didn't want to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you were selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.84,0:03:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I think you were pretty brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you said was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting just leads to more fighting\Nand then nothing ever gets resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother Jim used to say the\Nsame thing after he'd get beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind. Joe? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't keep things bottled up inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me about not being healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been not healthy my\Nwhole life, so I'm an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I want to keep\Nthings bottled up, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it looks like somebody\Nneeds a timeout in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to lend a friendly ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you were, Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a meteorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get rid of you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not trees, you're weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't all end like this,\Nnot before I beat Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that some sort of explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An earthquake? A meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I mean a whopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just crashed in the\Nforest! Totally cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's head over to\NPuppetmon's mansion instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll show you guys exactly where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Dark Masters and we'll\Nhave to fight him sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's time somebody cut his\Nstrings instead of waiting around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take the fight to him for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry up, I'm afraid that\Nboth our worlds will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's think this over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon is a Mega Digimon and we\Nwon't be able to defeat him that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, in that case, let's give\Nup and go watch cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only fair thing to\Ndo is to take a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those in favor of going to Puppetmon's\Nmansion, raise your hand and say aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ayes have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you didn't vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Matt would vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing him, he'd probably\Ngo the safe route.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Tai, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Matt not here, it's my job to\Nmake sure nothing happens to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're waiting for an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all we've been through, he\Ncan't really be thinking about going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're going,\Njust to take a look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we don't necessarily\Nhave to start any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's this way, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go along with your decision,\Nbut I'm still not sure it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, and we're not looking for\Ntrouble, but if anything happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon and I will hold off Puppetmon\Nwhile you take the others and escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:05:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, boys and girls, get\Nready for the comeback tour of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.35,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,300)}NOTE: The kanji on his chest say "Strongest."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The meteor landed up on that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where on earth\Nit could have come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably L .A. Huh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I smell something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over there. Wait. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might sweat and I keep\Nchipping on my roots
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think someone's hurt.\NHang in there. We're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get these branches off of him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon yikes we better get\Nout of here before he wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's hurt good\Nthen he won't be able to chase us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember him from file island He was\Nmeaner than a cat getting a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pretend like we never found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cut looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the DigiDestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you don't have amnesia,\Nbut try not to move anyway, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, go look for some healing herbs and\NGomamon, see if you can find some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Joe, I want you to... I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father is a doctor,\Nand he taught me a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to practice on my toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to move. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff burns! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big baby, don't you want to get better?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like his arm might be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to put it in a sling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, toilet paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have to do that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm using it as bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we came back to the digital\Nworld, I thought of things we might need,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and toilet paper was the first\Nthing that came to my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:07:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just about finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be two-ply.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay off the digivolving for a few\Ndays and you'll be as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, I never knew you were so resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you Digidestined\Nbeing so nice to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially after the way I tried\Nto destroy you on Vile Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have left me here to\Nrot, but instead you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we were taught that if someone's\Nin trouble, you always help them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means even if they were\Ntrying to pummel you into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I never thought of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's what friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They help each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never had any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you have them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Ogremon cry before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you need more\Ntoilet paper to blow your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'll just use my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta hurt with all those spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:08:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What has four strings and is made of wood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, a violin, but that's a good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you guys aren't music lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's you we don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can also play a really mean saxophone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a Digivolve! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what if Togemon gets\Nhurt during the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon, Digivolve! Right! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End your champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go mom on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolves to Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:09:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, into ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this! Puppet hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppet hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me playtime's over! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get giddy with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Edamon's in the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A superstar like me deserves\Na little applause, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it's been so long\Nsince we've seen each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's Etemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to be Etemon, kid,\Nbut that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm Metal Etemon. Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.86,0:12:09.87,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}MetalEtemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.86,0:12:09.87,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.86,0:12:09.87,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.86,0:12:09.87,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.86,0:12:09.87,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.86,0:12:09.87,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Banana Slip
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thought Etemon was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Edamon's a mega-digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After his banana slip attack, he'll\Nhave to peel us off the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what we need, new and unimproved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you how I became me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now here's what transpired when\Nit uninspired. Listen up, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you all remember the\Nbattle I had with Metal Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, he's one\Ntough dinosaur, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I was swallowed\Nup by black holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I gave it indigestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My digital information was\Nscattered throughout the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pulled myself together and chilled\Nout for a while in Digimon Limbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My information was chopped, fixed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whipped, and pureed I felt\Nlike a four-speed blender,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honey But I refused to return to the\Ndigital world until I was bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fatter And had a full\Nhead of beautiful metal
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hair Now I'm back to\Nget my revenge on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined I got the\Nlow-down, dirty, revengeful. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking big-time ditching this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got started there,\Nyou oversized footstool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling oversized?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your step. Banana slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much of a wax and build-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppet power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use you as a toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit, hit, hit, hit attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal power! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You point dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not dirty, I just got detailed\Nat the car wash yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's Puppetmon's mansion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:13:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See who they are. Analyze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them is Floramon.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.98,0:14:10.99,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Floramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.98,0:14:10.99,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.98,0:14:10.99,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.98,0:14:10.99,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Plant Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.98,0:14:10.99,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.98,0:14:10.99,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Allergy Shower
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a plant-type Digimon\Nwho digivolves like a reptile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her attack is Rain of Pollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the other guard is... Deramon.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.66,0:14:19.17,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Deramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.66,0:14:19.17,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.66,0:14:19.17,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.66,0:14:19.17,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Bird Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.66,0:14:19.17,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.66,0:14:19.17,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Royal Nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first glance, it looks\Nlike a bird-type Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's actually got a plant\Ngrowing out of its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're not ultimate Digimon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, we should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could be quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we go? Wait! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There might be more guards inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go inside and make\Nsure the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys wait here until I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, I think Patamon and\NI should go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we're the only ones who\Nknow where everything is inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it might be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tai, don't treat\Nme like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we go together, as a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I vote with Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid\Nof if we all go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cool it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate tickling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can finally take care of those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, you\Npiece of rotten driftwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You recycle tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big dumb knothole. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where you going? Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lousy at name calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm metal and you're wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say bounces off\Nof me and splits you in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who needs him anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can find an old Digi-Dest in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I am the\Nultimate metal detector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sister's name, my darling champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him! Pepperbread!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanted fried\Nchicken, you could've asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we thought you guys were out\Nhere protecting Puppetmon's mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you barbecue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not here protecting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're supposed to\Nbe Puppetmon's playmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, someone to chase around\Nand attack when he gets bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me fill you in on a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon is an obnoxious jerk, and none\Nof us around this place can stand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon doesn't have any friends,\Neven though he thinks he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what could be worse than having\Na life without a single friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A litter box lined with flypaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is Puppetmon inside\Nthe house right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's out being\Nfumigated for termites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what should we do, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now's a good chance to\Ntake a look inside the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon, will you show us around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I used to be a tour\Nguide at Digimon Studios.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no video cameras, flash photography,\Nfood or drink are allowed during the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main structure was built\Nbefore the digital revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How hard could it be to\Nfind a bunch of kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, does it still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know how I\Ncan ever thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to thank us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an ancient tradition to\Nrepay all acts of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's part of my sacred\Nmoral code as an Ogremon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sacred moral code?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A member of King Arthur's\Ncourt or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'll try to\Nbe meaner next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll ruin your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a jack-in-the-box\Nwith a serious attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:18:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be leading us into\Nsome sort of trap, would you, Deramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never try anything\Nas deceitful as Puppetmon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cross my wings, and hope to fly honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe him, Tai. How\Nabout you? Hmm. Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a toy! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening? Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a heat-activated bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I said don't touch anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon, can I ask you\Na personal question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't floss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I was going to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you fight with Leomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hate him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's not a question of hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our destiny to fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I will be rivals for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's your only purpose in life,\Nwhat would happen if you actually won?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never really thought about it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll take a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cruise is always nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:18:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if the fight's over, you\Nwouldn't have a rival anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I are like two old warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting a war that had no\Nbeginning and has no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, the only reason I exist\Nat all is to defeat Leomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if he were gone,\Nwell, I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to have more of a purpose\Nin life than to just defeat Leomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rivalry is as old as time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it after\NI've defeated Leomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting way too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better take your blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came from out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who should I pray with next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon's coming back. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would help if I had some\Nidea of how this worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's against every\Nprinciple I stand for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, what the heck, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't tell Puppetmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I've got him in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, aim, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.15,0:20:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's shooting at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know who it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Dizzy Dusty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair,\Nyou're using my toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hide from me,\NI'm the king of swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend or foe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be gone and enjoy going\Non the run Even if I go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll continue going on the sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just keep the pain.\NThe adventure I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to bring The adventure\NI'm not so deep I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not scared of my future.\NI'll be fine with my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Days I'll be fine with\Nyour smile. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of my\Nheart. I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to be one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive. I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at the sky. It's still
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting to start. It's\Na dream of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.86,0:22:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, the final massacre\Nmust be carried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is Cool Brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.50,0:22:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lots of memories which we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children... You!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch this, Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time, the Dragon's\NAdventure is the Dragon's Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:22:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the dragon has evolved.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.94,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}O Wind! O Light! SaberLeomon

